# ── 21. numbered menu entries + Tab opens the menu (no Tab action bar) ─
# a) DContextMenu gains `numberedKeys` (default false, so every other DMS
#    menu is unchanged): each selectable entry shows its key -- 1-9, 0, then
#    a-z -- and pressing it activates that entry (submenus drill in, as on
#    Enter). LauncherContextMenu turns it on.
# b) Tab / Shift+Tab no longer open the stock action bar along the bottom;
#    Tab opens the numbered menu instead (same as Right at the end of the
#    query, but from anywhere in it). Both launcher layouts.
